            # 0.011622501162250116 % (1 instance). obj: <http://dbpedia.org/datatype/</span></span> de bestuurders moeten voorrang verlenen aan iedere bestuurder die rijdt op de openbare weg of de rijbaan die ze oprijden. <span class=\"say-location-variable\" data-say-variable=\"true\" data-say-variable-type=\"location\" data-label=\"locatie2\" data-source=\"https://register.mobiliteit.vlaanderen.be/sparql\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/b69a2658-cb01-486a-8a45-dae25e77a6f1\" property=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value\" data-literal-node=\"true\" data-say-id=\"c605911e-df12-4b91-8564-333fe5d84576\" datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string\"><span class=\"say-hidden\" data-rdfa-container=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><span data-external-triple-container=\"true\"><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/b69a2658-cb01-486a-8a45-dae25e77a6f1\" property=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type\" resource=\"http://lblod.data.gift/vocabularies/variables/VariableInstance\"></span><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/b69a2658-cb01-486a-8a45-dae25e77a6f1\" property=\"http://lblod.data.gift/vocabularies/variables/instanceOf\" resource=\"http://data.lblod.info/mappings/61B1F627BF5C7500090001BF\"></span><span property=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/type\" content=\"codelist\" datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/b69a2658-cb01-486a-8a45-dae25e77a6f1\"></span><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/b69a2658-cb01-486a-8a45-dae25e77a6f1\" property=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/source\" resource=\"https://register.mobiliteit.vlaanderen.be/sparql\"></span></span></span><span data-content-container=\"true\">Op de Peperstraat geldt:</span></span> de bestuurders hebben voorrang.  </p><p class=\"say-paragraph\">Dit wordt aangeduid door verkeerstekens:</p><ul hierarchical=\"false\" class=\"say-bullet-list\" style=\"\"><li c