   <https://say.data.gift/ns/body>  <http://dbpedia.org/datatype/</span></span>  het parkeren is toegelaten;  het parkeren is voorbehouden voor <span class=\"say-codelist-variable\" data-say-variable=\"true\" data-say-variable-type=\"codelist\" data-label=\"categorie_voertuig\" data-codelist=\"http://lblod.data.gift/concept-schemes/61AE3534BF5C750009000050\" data-source=\"https://register.mobiliteit.vlaanderen.be/sparql\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/3e4f4828-44c7-48d1-8ce6-88cbb3f07fea\" property=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value\" data-literal-node=\"true\" data-say-id=\"4bd242f7-99fb-4c33-a1de-bc079c57f12a\" datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string\"><span class=\"say-hidden\" data-rdfa-container=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><span data-external-triple-container=\"true\"><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/3e4f4828-44c7-48d1-8ce6-88cbb3f07fea\" property=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type\" resource=\"http://lblod.data.gift/vocabularies/variables/VariableInstance\"></span><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/3e4f4828-44c7-48d1-8ce6-88cbb3f07fea\" property=\"http://lblod.data.gift/vocabularies/variables/instanceOf\" resource=\"http://data.lblod.info/mappings/61AE3580BF5C750009000054\"></span><span property=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/type\" content=\"codelist\" datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/3e4f4828-44c7-48d1-8ce6-88cbb3f07fea\"></span><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/3e4f4828-44c7-48d1-8ce6-88cbb3f07fea\" property=\"https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit#codelijst\" resource=\"http://lblod.data.gift/concept-schemes/61AE3534BF5C750009000050\"></span><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/3e4f4828-44c7-48d1-8ce6-88cbb3f07fea\" property=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/source\" resource=\"https://register.mobiliteit.vlaanderen.be/sparql\"></span></span></span><span data-content-container=\"true\">voertuigen die gebruikt worden door personen met een handicap</span></span>;  de parkeerreglementering geldt over een afstand van <span class=\"say-number-variable\" data-say-variable=\"true\" data-say-variable-type=\"number\" data-written-number=\"false\" data-label=\"aanduiding_afstand\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/c4a049d5-8237-452c-84e6-3369bb39b8d9\" property=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value\" content=\"6\" data-literal-node=\"true\" data-say-id=\"d6b007ce-91f4-4c70-a755-34f3e31854cb\" datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#number\"><span class=\"say-hidden\" data-rdfa-container=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><span data-external-triple-container=\"true\"><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/c4a049d5-8237-452c-84e6-3369bb39b8d9\" property=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type\" resource=\"http://lblod.data.gift/vocabularies/variables/VariableInstance\"></span><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/c4a049d5-8237-452c-84e6-3369bb39b8d9\" property=\"http://lblod.data.gift/vocabularies/variables/instanceOf\" resource=\"http://data.lblod.info/mappings/61ADE90ABF5C750009000024\"></span><span property=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/type\" content=\"number\" datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/c4a049d5-8237-452c-84e6-3369bb39b8d9\"></span></span></span><span data-content-container=\"true\">6</span></span> m.</p><p class=\"say-paragraph\">Dit wordt aangeduid door verkeerstekens:</p><ul hierarchical=\"false\" class=\"say-bullet-list\" style=\"\"><li class=\"say-list-item\" data-list-marker=\"1. \"><p class=\"say-paragraph\"><span class=\"say-inline-rdfa\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/verkeerstekens/a0b0257c-3c0d-46a3-89e6-fc9c70e08810\" data-say-id=\"30f5952c-0a39-4c4f-bb94-e2d64caddd8c\"><span class=\"say-hidden\" data-rdfa-container=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><span