   <https://say.data.gift/ns/body>  <http://dbpedia.org/datatype/</span></span>  de toegang is verboden in beide richtingen, voor iedere bestuurder;  de maatregel geldt niet voor <span class=\"say-text-variable\" data-say-variable=\"true\" data-say-variable-type=\"text\" data-label=\"categorie_voertuig\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/4885c138-c1d3-4b5f-a24b-086aae498b96\" property=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value\" data-literal-node=\"true\" data-say-id=\"3ce8321e-f047-4511-9435-0db810d473ce\" datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string\"><span class=\"say-hidden\" data-rdfa-container=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"><span data-external-triple-container=\"true\"><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/4885c138-c1d3-4b5f-a24b-086aae498b96\" property=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type\" resource=\"http://lblod.data.gift/vocabularies/variables/VariableInstance\"></span><span about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/4885c138-c1d3-4b5f-a24b-086aae498b96\" property=\"http://lblod.data.gift/vocabularies/variables/instanceOf\" resource=\"http://data.lblod.info/mappings/61ADF0F2BF5C75000900002C\"></span><span property=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/type\" content=\"text\" datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/variable-instances/4885c138-c1d3-4b5f-a24b-086aae498b96\"></span></span></span><span data-content-container=\"true\">gebruikers van de parking van het Craenenplein</span></span>.</p><p class=\"say-paragraph\">Deze maatregel is geldig van vrijdag 12 december 2025 van 15u30 tot 23u00.</p><p class=\"say-paragraph\">Dit wordt aangeduid door verkeerstekens:</p><ul hierarchical=\"false\" class=\"say-bullet-list\" style=\"\"><li class=\"say-list-item\" data-list-marker=\"1. \"><p class=\"say-paragraph\"><span class=\"say-inline-rdfa\" about=\"http://data.lblod.info/verkeerstekens/7aa77013-95b9-42b6-8772-b17c7edeb7dd\" data-say-id=\"d1d2b0af-f52b-42fb-